description:
Design a pulse generator that detects a rising edge on the input signal D when synchronized with the clock signal Q. When a transition from LOW to HIGH occurs on D, the output pulse is set to HIGH for one clock cycle, and it returns to LOW thereafter. The module uses a state variable D_prev to track the previous state of D, ensuring that the pulse is produced only on the specific edge condition.
module top_module(
    input D,
    input Q,
    output reg pulse
);

code:
module top_module(
    input D,
    input Q,
    output reg pulse
);reg D_prev;

always @(posedge Q) begin
    if (D == 1'b1 && D_prev == 1'b0) begin
        pulse <= 1'b1;
    end else begin
        pulse <= 1'b0;
    end
    D_prev <= D;
end

endmodule

