description:
Implement a circuit that detects any edge transitions on an 8-bit input signal by generating a one-clock-cycle pulse for each change. The module utilizes a pair of registers to store the current and previous values of the input signal, and employs a logic operation to identify changes between these registered values. The output provides an indication of whether any bit in the input has changed state between consecutive clock cycles, effectively acting as a change detector for the input signal.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    input [7:0] in,
    output [7:0] anyedge
);

code:
